   2++7D86              ; PROJECT126 — selected SYSBIOS loader
   3++7D86              ;
   4++7D86              ; Selection is made in the ATM catalogue. TR-DOS access is restored using
   5++7D86              ; the same pre-video mapping as initial startup; the chosen 8 KiB .C file is
   6++7D86              ; staged in page 0, then sent as ABI 1.1 IMAGE BEGIN/FRAGMENT/FINISH frames.
